The five "Rostock Max V2 Single-Dual Wider Effector Platform" sources below, copied
verbatim from the pinned commit with the upstream LICENSE. Upstream keeps them in a
directory whose name contains spaces; they are vendored together under rostock-effector/
so the wrapper can address the tree without spaces, and the five files stay in one
directory because they `include <effector_constants.scad>` next to themselves. Every
file carries upstream's own "This file is public domain" header, which is compatible
with the repository's Apache-2.0 LICENSE.

The repository's "Rostock Max V2 Dual Extruder Holder" sources are deliberately NOT
vendored: extruder_holders.scad states "This file is GPL v3" and notes the SeeMeCNC
designs are "most likely noncommercial use", and extruder_holders.scad and
filament_wire_guide.scad depend on it.

